### Login de usuario
POST {{url}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
account: {{tenant}}

{
  "email": "{{username}}",
  "passwordHash": "{{password}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### saludo
GET {{url}}/jobs
account: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### lista de jobs accesibles por el admin
GET {{url}}/jobsAccessAdmin
account: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### lista de jobs accesibles por el user
GET {{url}}/jobsAccessUser
account: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### lista de jobs accesibles por el admin o el user
GET {{url}}/jobsAccessAdminOrUser
account: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### lista de jobs accesibles por el admin o el user
GET {{url}}/jobsAccessAdminT
account: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
